{%- comment -%}
  Footer (Layout=Standard)
  Manjula: image band (ratio 12:5 from lg, 600px at 1440; the photo 13:12 below lg, 390x360 in Figma) with the newsletter card (Newsletter signup Layout=Card) over its
  bottom-left 9 columns from lg and stacked under it on mobile; the full-width wordmark; then the menu columns plus
  Follow us, each in a Light sm Bracket (accordions with a caps title below lg, Follow us stays open).
  Settings: image (band photo, footer-band-sofa.jpg in the store Files; empty renders the Media placeholder), newsletter_title and newsletter_text (blank falls
  back to the newsletter.* locale strings). No bottom bar (removed 19 Nov: no copyright, policies, localization or
  payment icons in the footer).
  Menus: the top-level links of the `footer-2026` menu (new menu, the live `footer` stays untouched) are the column headings, their child links the column links; a menu without child links becomes one column titled with the menu name; without a `footer-2026` menu the main menu is used. Texts: locale keys `footer.*`.
  Reveal (lg and up only, none on mobile): the wordmark and menu columns (footer-reveal) are sticky to the bottom of the screen, under the image band
  (z-10), so the band and newsletter card scroll up off them while they stay put. Nothing is animated. footer-reveal
  (global.js) only sets --reveal-bottom: 0, or minus the overflow when the part is taller than the screen, so its top
  stays in view and all of it can be read. While it is revealed, its content ([data-footer-reveal-inner]) moves up from
  30% lower to its place (scroll-linked, small parallax); overflow-hidden clips it. An Ink overlay
  ([data-footer-reveal-overlay]) fades from 15% to nothing at the same time (a subtle shade on the part still covered).
  No parallax: the photos stay still (Hendrik, 23 Nov; the <paralax-img> effect was removed site wide).
  Show newsletter and Show social are not parameters; a store removes what it does not need from this file.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign menu = linklists['footer-2026']
  if menu == blank
    assign menu = linklists['main-menu']
  endif
  assign nested = false
  for column in menu.links
    if column.links.size > 0
      assign nested = true
    endif
  endfor
  assign menu_label = 'footer.menu_label' | t
  assign follow_label = 'footer.follow_us' | t
-%}
<footer class="footer bg-background text-text">
  <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col bg-background lg:block lg:aspect-[12/5]">
    <div class="relative aspect-[13/12] overflow-hidden bg-surface-alt lg:absolute! lg:inset-0 lg:aspect-auto lg:size-full">
      {% render 'media', media: section.settings.image, ratio: 'fill', sizes: '100vw', class: 'absolute! inset-0 size-full' %}
    </div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto h-full w-full max-w-page lg:grid lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-end lg:gap-x-gutter lg:px-page-margin lg:pb-5">
      <div class="bg-background px-page-margin pb-10 pt-8 lg:col-span-9 lg:h-94 lg:p-13">
        {% render 'newsletter-signup',
          id: 'footer-newsletter',
          layout: 'card',
          input_style: 'underline',
          title: section.settings.newsletter_title,
          description: section.settings.newsletter_text,
          show_fine_print: false,
          class: 'h-full'
        %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer-reveal class="block bg-background lg:sticky lg:bottom-(--reveal-bottom) lg:z-0 lg:overflow-hidden">
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-10 hidden bg-text opacity-0 lg:block" aria-hidden="true" data-footer-reveal-overlay></div>
    <div data-footer-reveal-inner>
      <div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-page flex-col gap-10 px-page-margin pb-10 pt-5 lg:gap-18 lg:pb-20">
        <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}" class="block text-text [&_svg]:block [&_svg]:h-auto [&_svg]:w-full" aria-label="{{ shop.name | escape }}">
          {{- 'logo.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
        </a>

        <nav aria-label="{{ menu_label }}">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between max-lg:hidden">
            {%- for column in menu.links -%}
              {%- if nested and column.links.size == 0 -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
              {%- liquid
                if nested
                  assign column_title = column.title | escape
                  assign column_links = column.links
                else
                  assign column_title = menu.title | escape
                  assign column_links = menu.links
                endif
              -%}
              <div class="relative flex w-50 flex-col gap-10 p-3">
                {% render 'bracket', size: 'sm', strength: 'light' %}
                {% render 'menu-heading', title: column_title, style: 'caps' %}
                {% render 'menu-links', links: column_links, size: 'sm', spacing: 'loose' %}
              </div>
              {%- unless nested -%}{%- break -%}{%- endunless -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
            <div class="relative flex w-50 flex-col gap-10 p-3">
              {% render 'bracket', size: 'sm', strength: 'light' %}
              {% render 'menu-heading', title: follow_label, style: 'caps' %}
              {% render 'social-links', size: 'sm' %}
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 lg:hidden">
            <div>
              {%- assign footer_group = 'footer-' | append: section.id -%}
              {%- for column in menu.links -%}
                {%- if nested and column.links.size == 0 -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
                {%- liquid
                  if nested
                    assign column_title = column.title | escape
                    assign column_links = column.links
                  else
                    assign column_title = menu.title | escape
                    assign column_links = menu.links
                  endif
                -%}
                {%- capture column_content -%}{% render 'menu-links', links: column_links, size: 'sm', spacing: 'loose' %}{%- endcapture -%}
                {% render 'accordion-item', title: column_title, icon: 'plus', style: 'caps', content: column_content, name: footer_group %}
                {%- unless nested -%}{%- break -%}{%- endunless -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
              {% render 'menu-heading', title: follow_label, style: 'caps' %}
              {% render 'social-links', size: 'sm' %}
            </div>
          </div>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer-reveal>
</footer>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Footer",
  "tag": "div",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Image band" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "newsletter_title", "label": "Newsletter title", "default": "Sign up to our newsletter" },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "newsletter_text",
      "label": "Newsletter text",
      "default": "Get Ayurvedic rituals, ingredient stories, and skincare guidance in your inbox. Plus 10% off your first order."
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
